  "description": "Ever since his father rescued him from a rampaging beast in the forest as a child, Vargas was determined to become a knight. He never forgot the silhouette of his father's back, standing undaunted before the massive beast. Quickly becoming renowned for his skills with a blade, some speculate that if he had only chosen to remain with the knights, he would have risen to their top ranks, and young knights would have been inspired by the dauntless silhouette of his own back.",
